    "head_branch": "feature/hp-and-cooldown-in-store",
    "head_commit_message": "perf(formation): the re-form's occupancy reads places from typed locals\n\nSquadPlaces.occupancy, and SquadPlaces.places for more than two units, read\nranks and columns from typed locals of the table they fetch, instead of a\nUnitPlace.read call and two untyped indexings per unit. Step 4a had put that\ncall where unit.rank and unit.column were read, and #229's benches showed\nthe occupancy 35 to 46% slower. Outcomes are unchanged: the same places are\nread.\n\nThe spec also records that stamina and recovery, whose code hasn't changed\nsince step 3, swing by more on this step's runs than #229 measured.\n\nWaived-by: Decision 142\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KKUhViTbS7kfMBSZozDAco",
